OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and bright start for
OL,6,Fmost, but western areas will see a
OL,7,Fscattering of showers. These showers
OL,8,Fmay drift eastwards throughout the
OL,9,Fday, but many eastern areas likely to
OL,10,Fremain dry. Feeling pleasantly warm in
OL,11,Fthe sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers will soon fade this
OL,14,Fevening, leaving a dry night with
OL,15,Fclear spells. Cloud may build towards
OL,16,Fdawn in the far west, but it will stay
OL,17,Fmild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
