OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA bright start but cloud
OL,6,Fand outbreaks of rain will spread
OL,7,Feastwards throughout the day. Some
OL,8,Fbrighter interludes developing in-
OL,9,Fbetween the rain, especially in the
OL,10,Feast. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,13,Fand brighter on Thursday, before
OL,14,Ffurther outbreaks of rain arrives for
OL,15,Fovernight and into Friday. Drier,
OL,16,Fbrighter and warmer again on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
